// Character-camera traversal authority for every selectable Map scenario.
//
// Generated destinations resolve by stable MapAnchor name. `expected` is only a
// stale-evidence detector for the pinned hero seed: when generation moves an anchor,
// the walk must fail until its new view has been reviewed. Authored destinations use
// Exact. Sky Islands deliberately names only its ordinary ground bridge; the upper
// surfaces remain flight-gated and are not fake-walked by this manifest.
// `azimuth_turns` are absolute offsets from the scenario's authored launch yaw;
// executable `OrbitCamera` gestures are relative and cumulative.
